{
    "title": "GeoSmile - Move to Earn Money",
    "description": "\u2022\tHow Does GeoSmile Work?\r\nJust download the app and start moving. It's that simple!\r\nGeoSmile is a one-of-a-kind app that is tailor-made to suit your goals and habits by rewarding you for both driving and physical activity!\r\nGeoSmile will automatically keep track of your steps, distance, and mode of transportation, which you can reflect on using the in-app log. You can walk, run, bike, drive, or use any other way of moving around.\r\nYou will be rewarded for your movement and activities with points!\r\nYou can continuously redeem these points for amazing rewards, such as e-gift cards from popular brands like PayPal, Amazon, Roblox, and Starbucks: no purchases necessary.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tAre There Other Ways to Earn Points?\r\nGeoSmile even has you covered for your rest days! Maximize your earnings by completing anonymous surveys, playing games, and fulfilling other opportunities!\r\nWhy don't you invite your friends to GeoSmile?\r\nJust invite them and you both get 5000 points!\r\n\r\nNew Features\r\n - Missions: Beginner's Challenges out now! Get a head start on stacking up your points with daily quests and rewards! You will get 10,000 points after 8 days!\r\n - Lucky Wheel: Spin the wheel and win up to 100,000 points! Try your luck!\r\n\r\nPopular Features\r\n - Offers: You can earn a lot of points efficiently!\r\n - Survey: Just answer our surveys diligently!\r\n - Slot: Collect coins to win 777!\r\n\r\n\u2022\tCan I Use GeoSmile with Other Move to Earn apps?\r\nIt's Okay! We recommend using GeoSmile along with other M2E apps!\r\nOne Move brings you twice the profit!\r\n\r\n\u2022\tWhy Does GeoSmile Pay Me to Move?\r\nGeoSmile is run by GeoTechnologies Inc., a digital map data development company in Japan.\r\nIn order to keep digital maps in ideal shape, real-life data that allows for the depiction of live information (ie traffic jams, road closures, ideal routes, etc) are desirable.\r\nAfter the successful launch of TRIMA, which currently has over 19 million downloads in Japan, GeoSmile was created as the global version of the application.\r\nDue to the aid in creating digital map services TRIMA and GeoSmile app users provide the company through anonymized location data that allows for the collection of prior mentioned information, app users are compensated through points to be exchanged for e-gift cards.\r\nhttps://english.geot.jp/products/consumer_service/trip_mile/\r\n\r\nLearn more:\r\n\u2022 Website: geosmile.app/\r\n\u2022 Facebook: facebook.com/tripmile.app.global\r\n\u2022 Terms of Service/Privacy Policy: geosmile.app/privacypolicy",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2022\tHow Does GeoSmile Work?<br>Just download the app and start moving. It&#39;s that simple!<br>GeoSmile is a one-of-a-kind app that is tailor-made to suit your goals and habits by rewarding you for both driving and physical activity!<br>GeoSmile will automatically keep track of your steps, distance, and mode of transportation, which you can reflect on using the in-app log. You can walk, run, bike, drive, or use any other way of moving around.<br>You will be rewarded for your movement and activities with points!<br>You can continuously redeem these points for amazing rewards, such as e-gift cards from popular brands like PayPal, Amazon, Roblox, and Starbucks: no purchases necessary.<br><br>\u2022\tAre There Other Ways to Earn Points?<br>GeoSmile even has you covered for your rest days! Maximize your earnings by completing anonymous surveys, playing games, and fulfilling other opportunities!<br>Why don&#39;t you invite your friends to GeoSmile?<br>Just invite them and you both get 5000 points!<br><br>New Features<br> - Missions: Beginner&#39;s Challenges out now! Get a head start on stacking up your points with daily quests and rewards! You will get 10,000 points after 8 days!<br> - Lucky Wheel: Spin the wheel and win up to 100,000 points! Try your luck!<br><br>Popular Features<br> - Offers: You can earn a lot of points efficiently!<br> - Survey: Just answer our surveys diligently!<br> - Slot: Collect coins to win 777!<br><br>\u2022\tCan I Use GeoSmile with Other Move to Earn apps?<br>It&#39;s Okay! We recommend using GeoSmile along with other M2E apps!<br>One Move brings you twice the profit!<br><br>\u2022\tWhy Does GeoSmile Pay Me to Move?<br>GeoSmile is run by GeoTechnologies Inc., a digital map data development company in Japan.<br>In order to keep digital maps in ideal shape, real-life data that allows for the depiction of live information (ie traffic jams, road closures, ideal routes, etc) are desirable.<br>After the successful launch of TRIMA, which currently has over 19 million downloads in Japan, GeoSmile was created as the global version of the application.<br>Due to the aid in creating digital map services TRIMA and GeoSmile app users provide the company through anonymized location data that allows for the collection of prior mentioned information, app users are compensated through points to be exchanged for e-gift cards.<br>https://english.geot.jp/products/consumer_service/trip_mile/<br><br>Learn more:<br>\u2022 Website: geosmile.app/<br>\u2022 Facebook: facebook.com/tripmile.app.global<br>\u2022 Terms of Service/Privacy Policy: geosmile.app/privacypolicy",
